# Whitelist: everything is ignored unless listed here. The inputs (DEM, geoid,
# boundaries, OSM cache) and the per-zone working folders are large, third-party
# and re-creatable, so they never go in. PNG previews are not published.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE

!zones/
zones/*
!zones/zone_pipeline.py
!zones/run_atlas.py
!zones/run_nov.py
!zones/run_layouts.py
!zones/rebuild_layout_only.py
!zones/make_overrides_nov.py
!zones/compare_csv.py
!zones/zone_overrides.tsv

!output/
output/*
!output/*_TH-LDP.pdf
